{
    "_readme": [
        "ETC Eos starter preset for the 16-button + 3-knob macropad.",
        "Target: Eos Nomad on PC. Import via the IMPORT button, then UPLOAD.",
        "",
        "Maps the yellow 3-wide x 5-row Eos command block:",
        "  Row 1: Part / Cue / Record           -> the 3 knob PRESSES",
        "         (knob1_press, knob2_press, knob3_press)",
        "  Rows 2-5 x cols 1-3                   -> button grid columns 1-3",
        "  Button column 4 (button4/8/12/16)     -> Recall From / Copy To /",
        "                                           Q Only/Track / Thru",
        "",
        "Buttons are row-major: row1=button1..4, row2=button5..8,",
        "row3=button9..12, row4=button13..16. Knob ROTATION is intentionally",
        "left unmapped (use the mouse wheel over an encoder tile in Nomad).",
        "",
        "Shortcuts are BLANK ('') pending the exact Eos PC keyboard shortcuts.",
        "Fill each 'key' (and any ctrl/shift/alt/win) in '_suggested_layout',",
        "then move the entries into 'controls' and re-import.",
        "",
        "Spec format: {\"key\": \"<KEY_MAP name>\", \"ctrl\": true, ...}",
        "             {\"media\": \"<MEDIA_MAP name>\"} | {\"mouse\": \"...\"}",
        "Control names: button1..button16, knob1_ccw/cw/press .. knob3_*",
        "Note: Eos hardkey emulation from a keyboard usually needs Scroll Lock ON."
    ],
    "name": "ETC EOS",
    "color": "#2a6bd4",
    "led": 0,
    "controls": {},
    "_suggested_layout": {
        "knob1_press": {"eos": "Part",          "key": ""},
        "knob2_press": {"eos": "Cue",           "key": ""},
